was Simba&#x27;s first spouse.</p></div><details><summary>Time on the team</summary><p>Simba first became a Moderator March 9th of 2014, then became Developer on April 27 the same year, and has been the Owner since January 15th of 2015.</p></details></article><article class="staff-card" id="beccc"><div class="staff-heading"><img class="portrait" src="/assets/staff/beccc.jpg" alt="Beccc’s Minecraft character" loading="lazy"><div><div class="eyebrow">Head of Staff</div><h2>Beccc</h2></div></div><div class="bio"><p>Beccc is the Head of Staff (HoS) of Silver Springs Survival, otherwise known as Becc. As the HoS, she works with <a href="#mr_simba">Mr_Simba</a> on new and upcoming features for the server, as well as making sure the staff are able to do their job as intended.</p></div><details><summary>Time on the team</summary><p>Becc became a Moderator on the 5th of July 2015, then became an Admin on the 18th of March 2016. On January 29, 2019, Becc was promoted to the rank of HoS.</p></details></article><article class="staff-card" id="mrjoned"><div class="staff-heading"><img class="portrait" src="/assets/staff/mrjoned.jpg" alt="MrJoned’s Minecraft character" loading="lazy"><div><div class="eyebrow">Head of Fun</div><h2>MrJoned</h2></div></div><div class="bio"><p>MrJoned is the Head of Fun (HoF/Head of Fmemes) of Silver Springs Survival. Otherwise known as Jon, he also goes by James, or the Penguin man. He prefers to lick players he likes as opposed to being a normal person. He also records events, and fun things going on, on the server for his Youtube channel.</p><p>He is the worst mod. (Follow him on Twitter!) Despite being the worst mod, MrJoned also has a <a href="https://www.twitch.tv/mrjoned">Twitch</a> and a <a href="https://www.youtube.com/user/MrJoned15">Youtube</a> you should also follow!</p></div><details><summary>Time on the team</summary><p>MrJoned first became Moderator March 2nd of 2015 (along with <a href="#evildrac">EvilDrac</a>) and has been an admin since September 25th of the same year. On September 17, 2023, Jon became the new Head of Fun.</p></details></article><article class="staff-card" id="autumn_bun"><div class="staff-heading"><img class="portrait" src="/assets/staff/autumn_bun.jpg" alt="Autumn_Bun’s Minecraft character" loading="lazy"><div><div class="eyebrow">Designer</div><h2>Autumn_Bun</h2></div></div><div class="bio"><p>Autumn Bun is the Designer of Silver Springs Survival. She is very kind and makes everyone laugh. She is good friends with the owner, <a href="#mr_simba">Mr_Simba</a>. She primarily designs the custom content on the server such as the Runecrafting system and the Gemcrafting system!</p></div><details><summary>Time on the team</summary><p>Autumn Bun first became Moderator on October 12th of 2014 (along with <a href="#frostearrific">Frosty</a>) and has been Admin since November 2014. She then stepped up under the Designer role on September 20th, 2023 in recognition of designing, drafting, and testing most of the custom content on our server.</p></details></article><article class="staff-card" id="cubicbits"><div class="staff-heading"><img class="portrait" src="/assets/staff/cubicbits.jpg" alt="CubicBits’s Minecraft character" loading="lazy"><div><div class="eyebrow">Admin</div><h2>CubicBits</h2></div></div><div class="bio"><p>CubicBits is an Admin of Silver Springs Survival. He is a fairly active watermelon who spends his spare time chilling in the ocean. </p></div><details><summary>Time on the team</summary><p>CubicBits became a Moderator on April 24th, 2020 alongside <a href="#drfeesh">DrFeesh</a> and <a href="#lukayva">LunaPotato</a>, and became an Admin on September 20th, 2023.</p></details></article><article class="staff-card" id="evildrac"><div class="staff-heading"><img class="portrait" src="/assets/staff/evildrac.jpg" alt="EvilDrac’s Minecraft character" loading="lazy"><div><div class="eyebrow">Admin</div><h2>EvilDrac</h2></div></div><div class="bio"><p>EvilDrac is an Admin of Silver Springs Survival and the founder of the Wiki, and is otherwise known as Drac or Ber. He is very fond of magic and has expressed interest in alchemy. In the real world, however, Drac holds an interest in digital designing and creative works.</p></div><details><summary>Time on the team</summary><p>EvilDrac became a Moderator on March 2nd, 2015 (along with <a href="#mrjoned">MrJoned</a>) and was an Admin starting July 15th of the same year up until January 1st, 2018, when he stepped down to the Mod position for personal reasons. </p><p>On April 21st 2020, EvilDrac re-a s c e n d e d.</p></details></article><article class="staff-card" id="frostearrific"><div class="staff-heading"><img class="portrait" src="/assets/staff/frostearrific.jpg" alt="Frostearrific’s Minecraft character" loading="lazy"><div><div class="eyebrow">Admin</div><h2>Frostearrific</h2></div></div><div class="bio"><p>Frostearrific is an admin on Silver Springs Survival, otherwise known as Frosty. She is a laid back staffer often using dead memes and frequently farting. Extremely fond of farming, she is often called the Farming Queen or Farming Maniac. Frosty also goes by the nicknames Frooty, Fronky, or Frothy. She is a lover of sheep, poros, and all things floofy.</p></div><details><summary>Time on the team</summary><p>Frostearrific first became a Moderator October 12th of 2014 (along with <a href="#autumn_bun">Autumn Bun</a>) and first became an Admin in November of 2014.</p></details></article><article class="staff-card" id="drfeesh"><div class="staff-heading"><img class="portrait" src="/assets/staff/drfeesh.jpg" alt="DrFeesh’s Minecraft character" loading="lazy"><div><div class="eyebrow">Moderator</div><h2>DrFeesh</h2></div></div><div class="bio"><p>DrFeesh is a Moderator of Silver Springs Survival, otherwise known as Will. He is a prodigy among fish and is known server-wide for healing the fish of the land of Squid.</p></div><details><summary>Time on the team</summary><p>DrFeesh became a Moderator April 24th, 2020, alongside <a href="#cubicbits">CubicBits</a>, and <a href="#lukayva">LunaPotato</a>.</p></details></article><article class="staff-card" id="lukayva"><div class="staff-heading"><img class="portrait" src="/assets/staff/lukayva.jpg" alt="Lukayva’s Minecraft character" loading="lazy"><div><div class="eyebrow">Moderator</div><h2>Lukayva</h2></div></div><div class="bio"><p>Lukayva is a Moderator of Silver Springs Survival. She is the master of all things spooky, and specializes in fitting as many decorations into her builds as possible.</p></div><details><summary>Time on the team</summary><p>Lukayva became a Moderator April 22nd 2020, alongside <a href="#cubicbits">CubicBits</a>, and <a href="#drfeesh">DrFeesh</a>.</p></details></article></div></section><div class="contentband"><section class="wrap founder-layout"><div><div class="eyebrow">Where it all began</div><h2>Our founders.</h2><p>A place in the story of Silver Springs, and a part of the community’s history.</p><div class="founder-names"><span>Wolfwoodnyo</span><span>Merlin</span><span>Kanrilla</span></div></div><img src="/assets/staff/founders.jpg" alt="Minecraft characters of Silver Springs founders Wolfwoodnyo, Merlin, and Kanrilla" loading="lazy"></section></div><div class="wrap after-section"><section class="join"><div class="eyebrow">Your next chapter</div><h2>Say hello.</h2><p>Get to know the team and the rest of the community, in-game or on Discord.</p><div class="actions"><button class="btn primary" data-copy="sssminecraft.com">Copy IP: sssminecraft.com</button><a class="btn" href="https://discord.gg/r22U3prgPE">Join our Discord ↗</a></div></section></div></main>
